  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Universal SRHR of vulnerable adolescents in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3-year Euro 10M EC funded project across 6 countries in WACA region (Burkina Faso, Sierra Leone, Guinea, Guinea Bissau, Togo, Benin and FEMNET in Kenya (0.5 - 1M project participants)).  Plan Denmark consortium lead, Plan UK holds agreements with SLE and FEMNET (Euro 2.6M). Strengthening comprehensive sexuality education (CSE) and adolescent responsive services (ARS) at national level and in 2 districts in SLE. 10-16 year olds - 60% girls. FEMNET leads and coordinates programme-wide advocacy for financing of and access to ASRHR.</narrative>
  </description>
